","text":"これはね、泣いちゃった後の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真なの〜。泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/12/13/2356400/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねね可愛い〜(❁´ω`❁)*✲ﾟ*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日の歌を歌っている途中に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆でねねの頭をぐちゃぐちゃに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"したり....何か乃木坂することが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いちいちほっこりするな♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしも寧々の頭ぐちゃぐちゃに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"したリーダーと言っても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"過言ではないが...笑い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにもかくにも寧々お誕生日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとっう♪前からも寧々とは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲良しだったけどアンダーに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なってからもっと仲良くなれた気がして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいです*✲ﾟ*｡ʚɞ⋆ྉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寧々と早く遊びたいっϚ•͇ꇵ͒•ོ͇Ͻ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも武道館ライブが終わって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"からになりそうだなっ。うん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/12/13/2356400/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねにとって幸せな1年に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なりますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと髪色についてたくさんの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お褒めの言葉。あたしには"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勿体無きお言葉。笑い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱ春でも夏でも秋でも冬でも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暗い色が1番だな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに春夏はピンクベージュ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に少しベージュ感を強くして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もらってました！えへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/12/13/2356400/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは最近まいやんちゃんの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶろぐでお騒がせになっている"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斉藤からでした♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイホームに帰ろう〜笑い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-33402":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/07/18/2510464/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナルトくんの方がかわいいポーズしてるっっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は梨花さんと一緒に"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/07/18/2510464/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NARUTO  THE  ＬＩＶＥ  2016"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にジャンポリから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出演アーティストさんにインタビューするという任務を遂行してきたよヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/07/18/2510464/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アニメ  NARUTO疾風伝の主題歌を歌われたアーティストさんや、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画の方の主題歌を歌われたアーティストさんもいて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NARUTOファンには堪らない1日でしたヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前日には銀魂の方のＬＩＶＥが行われていて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２つの作品がどれだけの人に愛されているか分かる時間だったと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のインタビューはつたない所しかなかったと思いますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後の方に舞台に出て挨拶をした時に、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"温かくお客様の皆さんが迎えてくださりました(´；ω；｀)⭐️⭐️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルだから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の好きな作品を好きと言った瞬間に、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嫌な思いをしてしまう方が少なからずいると思うのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私がNARUTOが大好きだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言う気持ちに嘘はないから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、昨日NARUTO大好きって気持ちを共有出来た様な気がして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に楽しかったです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもずーっとNARUTOが大好きです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャンプ読者である限り、毎日幸せですヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にジャンポリに出会えて感謝しています！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はFNSうたの夏まつりヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつの間にか裸足でSummer披露し終わりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/07/18/2510464/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てくれたかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜まで頑張ります〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ⭐️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ☆彡"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-22198":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"は～い（＾ω＾）\n皆 おつかれたま❤️\nまひろ と まいやんだよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/12/30/0237855/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近 本当に寒いけど皆大丈夫かな？\n手洗いうがいはしっかりするんだよ～（＾ω＾）❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日曜日は京都にて今年最後の個別握手会でした.\nその時のまに私服がこちら.＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/12/30/0237855/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワンピース.＊ カラータイツ.．"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆にいっぱい褒めてもらえた～（＾ω＾） わ～ 嬉しいね❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/12/30/0237855/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じっ❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/12/30/0237855/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デザインが本当にお気に入り。\nワンピースの中は エリがシルバーでいい感じの白のシャツを合わせました.＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/12/30/0237855/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どう？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/12/30/0237855/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これどこの国かなあ？？？\n本当 最高❤️ この絵の中に入り込みたい（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえばまだ海外に行ったことがない。\nみんなはオススメの国とかあるかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして京都の握手会に来てくれた皆さん、本当にありがとう❤️\n沢山の方とまた会えて,いっぱい握手できて嬉しかったです(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会まだ来たことないって方も 是非遊びに来てね～.＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まに．ちー．あみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/12/30/0237855/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まに．ちー．あみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/12/30/0237855/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣￣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ～こんな写真でも載せよっかな。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみの髪セット中...笑\n(マネージャーさん撮影)❤️\nすごい！ いっぱいピンささってた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/12/30/0237855/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい！\nこんな形の箱初めて見た（＾ω＾）わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/12/30/0237855/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カーナビ『乃木坂46navi』が発売中です！！！\n本当にオススメです（＾ν＾）\n私もカーナビ選抜なので是非使ってみてくださいね❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年ももうすぐ終わりだね！\n頑張ろうね.＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まに,"}],"source":"archive"}}